{"id":"201c48982afc6187","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-knaster-tarski-lfp.md","title":"Knaster-Tarski Theorem","display":"thm-knaster-tarski-lfp — Knaster-Tarski Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-knaster-tarski-lfp","aliases":["57-thm-knaster-tarski-lfp"],"display":"thm-knaster-tarski-lfp — Knaster-Tarski Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-immediate-consequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-knaster-tarski-lfp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-knaster-tarski-lfp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-knaster-tarski-lfp — Knaster-Tarski Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"931bc3d500f82dff\" href=\"?note=931bc3d500f82dff\" title=\"57-df-immediate-consequence\">57-df-immediate-consequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}\">\\(P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}\\)</span> 是固定字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 上的程序，每条子句的头与体原子均为关系应用，不含内建等号；每条体有限，但 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 不必有限。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_P=B_S\">\\(B_P=B_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_P\">\\(T_P\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"931bc3d500f82dff\" href=\"?note=931bc3d500f82dff\" title=\"57-df-immediate-consequence\">57-df-immediate-consequence</a>。 对单调 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathcal P(B_P)\\to\\mathcal P(B_P)\">\\(F:\\mathcal P(B_P)\\to\\mathcal P(B_P)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lfp}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{lfp}(F)\\)</span> 由下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_P^n\">\\(T_P^n\\)</span> 是迭代，不是函数图幂。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lfp}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{I\\subseteq B_P:F(I)\\subseteq I\\},\\\\\nT_P^0(I)&amp;\\coloneqq I,\\qquad T_P^{n+1}(I)\\coloneqq T_P(T_P^n(I)),\\\\\nT_P\\uparrow\\omega&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}T_P^n(\\varnothing).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lfp}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{I\\subseteq B_P:F(I)\\subseteq I\\},\\\\\nT_P^0(I)&amp;\\coloneqq I,\\qquad T_P^{n+1}(I)\\coloneqq T_P(T_P^n(I)),\\\\\nT_P\\uparrow\\omega&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}T_P^n(\\varnothing).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_P(\\mathrm{lfp}(T_P))=\\mathrm{lfp}(T_P)=\\bigcap\\{I\\subseteq B_P:T_P(I)\\subseteq I\\}=T_P\\uparrow\\omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_P(\\mathrm{lfp}(T_P))=\\mathrm{lfp}(T_P)=\\bigcap\\{I\\subseteq B_P:T_P(I)\\subseteq I\\}=T_P\\uparrow\\omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>ω 次迭代结论使用此处有限体的直接后果算子，不声称任意单调幂集算子都在 ω 步达到不动点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-immediate-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"931bc3d500f82dff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-immediate-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-immediate-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"931bc3d500f82dff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$ 是固定字母表 $S$ 上的程序，每条子句的头与体原子均为关系应用，不含内建等号；每条体有限，但 $P$ 不必有限。$B_P=B_S$、$T_P$ 取 [[57-df-immediate-consequence]]。 对单调 $F:\\mathcal P(B_P)\\to\\mathcal P(B_P)$，$\\mathrm{lfp}(F)$ 由下式定义；$T_P^n$ 是迭代，不是函数图幂。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"B_P=B_S","display":false},{"tex":"T_P","display":false},{"tex":"F:\\mathcal P(B_P)\\to\\mathcal P(B_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lfp}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"T_P^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lfp}(F)&\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{I\\subseteq B_P:F(I)\\subseteq I\\},\\\\\nT_P^0(I)&\\coloneqq I,\\qquad T_P^{n+1}(I)\\coloneqq T_P(T_P^n(I)),\\\\\nT_P\\uparrow\\omega&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}T_P^n(\\varnothing).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T_P(\\mathrm{lfp}(T_P))=\\mathrm{lfp}(T_P)=\\bigcap\\{I\\subseteq B_P:T_P(I)\\subseteq I\\}=T_P\\uparrow\\omega.","display":true}],"bytes":1189,"backlinks":[{"id":"7ed93be444b87576","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$ 是固定字母表 $S$ 上的程序，每条子句的头与体原子均为关系应用，不含内建等号；每条体有限，但 $P$ 不必有限。$B_P=B_S$、$T_P$ 取 [[57-df-immediate-consequence]]。 假定 $\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ne\\varnothing$。$\\mathfrak H_I(S)$ 取 [[57-df-herbrand-structure]]；$\\mathrm{lfp}$、$T_P^n$ 见 [[57-thm-knaster-tarski-lfp]]。$M_P$ 是最小模型的真基原子集合，不把该集合与结构有序对混同。"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-283","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-thm-Lomega1omega-downward-LS]]\n[[57-thm-Lomega1omega-interpolation]]\n[[57-thm-Lomega1omega-no-compactness]]\n[[57-thm-TP-monotone]]\n[[57-thm-acf-decidable]]\n[[57-thm-adequacy]]\n[[57-thm-assignment-composition]]\n[[57-thm-assignment-idempotent]]\n[[57-thm-back-and-forth-equivalence]]\n[[57-thm-beth-definability]]\n[[57-thm-birkhoff-variety]]\n[[57-thm-church-turing]]\n[[57-thm-church-undecidability]]\n[[57-thm-cnf-existence]]\n[[57-thm-coincidence-formula]]\n[[57-thm-coincidence-term]]\n[[57-thm-compactness]]\n[[57-thm-compact